# Local docs (planning, ideation, notes) — but decision logs are versioned
# operational history tied to the code (see docs/decisions/*). Use docs/* (not
# docs/) so the decisions subdir can be re-included; git cannot re-include a
# path whose parent directory is itself excluded.
docs/*
!docs/decisions/

